---
description: Never add Cursor co-author or Made-with trailers to git commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor git attribution

Never add any of these to commit messages, amend messages, PR bodies, or git CLI flags:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `--trailer` related to Cursor

If a commit tool or environment injects those, strip them before finishing. Commits belong only to the human author configured in git.
